{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10643030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10643030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064303001:0":{"text":"観客席は人々の歓声で沸き返り、熱気は昨日にも増して高まっていた。\n巨大な魔法投影には、大会のリアルタイム順位が鮮明に映し出されている。","source_cn":"看台人声鼎沸，气氛较昨日更为热烈。\\n巨大的魔法投影清...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DC408917C7F9974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064303002:0":{"text":"首位に君臨しているのは、「ラヴェジャー」と名付けられた大口径の連発火薬銃。そして連続で標的を貫通した数には――二位を大きく引き離す、驚異的な数字が示されていた。","source_cn":"名为践踏者的巨型口径连发火铳影像高悬榜首，其后是连续穿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F1BF8C609C41611","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::0":{"text":"レトゥムの大砲","source_cn":"勒图姆的大炮","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x987DB3D2CE67053F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064303003:0":{"text":"レディース＆ジェントルマーン！初日の硝煙が立ち込める中、一人のダークホースが彗星のごとく現れました！","source_cn":"女士们，先生们！首日车轮战的硝烟尚未散尽，一匹黑马已横...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EA0279606CFAC17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064303004:0":{"text":"ある謎の鍛冶職人が、主催側で支給した標準素材だけを用い、芸術とでも呼ぶべき武器を作り上げたのです！\nその連続貫通数は……なんと三十五です！これは二位の五倍という驚異的な数字であります！","source_cn":"一位神秘锻造大师，用主办方提供的标准材料，打造出了这把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x312121F152EBE8A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064303005:0":{"text":"第八工房――皆さん、ぜひこの番号を覚えておいてください！そこが謎の鍛冶職人の拠点です！","source_cn":"让我们记住这个编号——第八号工坊，它属于神秘锻造大师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C920BC2F19E77B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064303006:1":{"text":"第八工房……いったい誰なの？そんな凄腕職人がいるなんて、聞いたことないわよ！","source_cn":"八号，到底是谁？从没听说过有这么厉害的家伙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBA643055E58E66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064303007:0":{"text":"ああ……それに見ろよ、あの火薬銃の型破りな構造。まさか、禁術でも使ったんじゃないだろうな！？","source_cn":"看那火铳的结构，太狂野了！根本不是常规设计！不会是用了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF00DD6D52EA74729","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064303008:0":{"text":"ダークホースの登場に胸は躍りますが、大会はまだまだ続きます！それではこれより<style=\"highlight\">第二ラウンド</style>の、さらに厳しいルールを発表します！","source_cn":"黑马的诞生令人兴奋，但大赛还将继续！现在，我将宣布<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9818C8C0F4FB6EA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064303009:0":{"text":"今回は一対一による淘汰戦で、その課題は――<style=\"highlight\">冷兵器へのエンチャント</style>です！制限時間は前回と同じ、二十四時間となります！\n審査方法は、運営スタッフが付与された魔法を発動し、その性能と強度をテストするというものです！","source_cn":"这次的题目是——<style=highlight>为一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A1F91F1230EAD55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064303010:1":{"text":"勝者は最終ラウンドへ進出！敗者は……次回大会での幸運をお祈りしましょう！","source_cn":"胜者晋级，败者……很遗憾，只能预祝下一届好运了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02496F0EFB35590","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064303011:0":{"text":"一対一の淘汰戦という刺激的なルールに熱狂した観客たちが、さらに激しい歓声を上げる。","source_cn":"观众们发出更激烈的欢呼，一对一淘汰制，远比第一场集体测...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1270612484B3F121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:18::0":{"text":"魔法通信機","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064303012:0":{"text":"一方、クルルは魔法通信機をいじりながら、装置から響く司会者の声を聞くともなく聞いていた。","source_cn":"库露露摆弄着魔法传讯装置，装置中传出主持人冈罗洪亮的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7128FBA2EF28E661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064303013:0":{"text":"ん？レイヘイキにエンチャント？\nバクハツもしない武器なんて、なんか古臭いよネェ……","source_cn":"唔，附魔冷兵器？\\n不能爆炸，就是砍来砍去的，多老土啊。","s