,"variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064303019:0":{"text":"じゃあ、もう少し聞かせてくれる？そのエンチャントとやらと、アタシのド派手な大バクハツ、どっちが上なのかしら？","source_cn":"那你再说说，那个附魔什么什么的，和本偶像轰轰烈烈的爆炸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x095F84744EAACE28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064303020:0":{"text":"それは当然――","source_cn":"当然是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD426FCF05CADC466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064303021:0":{"text":"ストープッ！キミは黙ってなさい！アタシは鉄クズ頭に聞いてるのヨ！","source_cn":"停停，阿爆，让铁块头自己说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FF23F9FB9905545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064303022:0":{"text":"威力と危険性は、対等。","source_cn":"威力与风险，对等。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x850CD9AAB6745951","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064303023:0":{"text":"魔紋強化、一段ごとに制御圧が倍増。\n高リスク。","source_cn":"魔纹能量每提升一次，所需压制力倍增。\\n高风险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58A7C67BDBB0FB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064303024:0":{"text":"加えて、制限時間、一日。","source_cn":"且，竞赛，一天时限。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35FA1BD941921CB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064303025:0":{"text":"だからどっちなの！ハッキリ言いなさいヨ！でもまあ……ちょーっとだけおもしろそうかも！","source_cn":"还是没有说嘛！不过听起来稍微有那么一丢丢意思了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8CECC6B286CDF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064303026:0":{"text":"そんな第八工房に対するのは――オルディン村が誇る熟練職人、ボヴァ・アイアンフーフさんです！","source_cn":"第八号工坊的黑马选手，对阵的是，来自深岩村的，资深工匠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x313C16EA0B085373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064303027:0":{"text":"ボヴァさんは卓越した鍛造技術と……独自の生産ラインを確立した名工であります！","source_cn":"博瓦以其精湛的锻造技艺和……独有的标准化生产线而闻名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC703313CE9B98F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064303028:0":{"text":"ボヴァさんよ！彼の生産ラインは反則級って話よ！大量の武器から出来のいいものだけ選び抜き、失敗のリスクを極限まで下げられるんだって。","source_cn":"是博瓦！他的生产线太作弊了！听说在制好模具后，能集中生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F92A089759576B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064303029:0":{"text":"ダークホースか知らないが、どうやらここまでみたいだな。もともとは無名の雑魚、運よく第二ラウンドに上がれただけさ。","source_cn":"这匹黑马看来要止步于此了。不过本来也只是个毫无名气的小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA98DB19C57DA9FE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064303030:0":{"text":"フンッ！アタシたちが負けるワケないでしょ！生産ラインのなにがスゴいって言うの！そんなのに頼るなんて、時代遅れのジジイだけヨ！","source_cn":"哼！凭什么觉得你会输，那个博瓦有什么了不起的！不就是有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1475C8E661CA342E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064303031:0":{"text":"その通り！クルル様の崇拝者が、あんな田舎者に負けるはずがございません！","source_cn":"就是就是！库露露大人的粉丝怎么可能输给那种土包子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35DC830528F55043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064303032:1":{"text":"効率生産、最良のものを選別。\n手法は、合理的。","source_cn":"高效生产，优中选优。\\n方法，合理。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E2334F9E6A98D57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064303033:0":{"text":"ちょっと、なんで相手の肩を持ってんのヨ！アンタはどっちの味方なの！？","source_cn":"喂，你还在帮对手说话？你到底哪边的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2C7C9368FBFEA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064303034:0":{"te